+issueNumber: MDL-89296
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new PHP API for mounting React components has been added. Use
+        `$OUTPUT->render(new \core\output\react_component($component, $props))`
+        or `$OUTPUT->react_component($component, $props)` instead of generating
+        the `data-react-component` and `data-react-props` attributes manually.
+        A new `\core\output\react_renderable` interface allows renderables to be
+        rendered as React components; it has a higher precedence than
+        `named_templatable`, and a lower precedence than a matching
+        `render_[renderable]` method in the renderer.
+      type: improved
